{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/4ae977b88a0f3dd069b59a72656c8630.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udce2 Get your party ready for an online Social Deduction game for 2\u20138 players! Step into the role of a Special Agent in a thrilling showdown between two sides:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\udd39 Spies who must blend in with NPCs and complete secret missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\udd39 Detectives who must expose the Spies hiding among the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Sharpen your skills to act natural and outsmart the Detectives or use your eagle eyes to hunt down the Spies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd2b When Spies and Detectives collide, the real game begins in AGENT VERSUS! \ud83c\udfae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1af3c372912e7d180699b781e59dfbef.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/d6c1270c347dbc1fc55d8763a36eb98c.avif?t=1762295066\" width=734 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/aba79cc3d31ce2fe8616cad5f39970eb.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc53 <strong>Disguise!</strong> Blend in as one of 12 NPC characters and copy their behaviors as naturally as possible. Don\u2019t let the Detectives notice anything odd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/abb42c0c6bccc6acef731852342fda1f.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/abb42c0c6bccc6acef731852342fda1f.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/abb42c0c6bccc6acef731852342fda1f.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc53 <strong>Do Missions!</strong> Check the top-right corner for active tasks. Follow the orange highlights on the map to complete objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc65 <strong>Team Up!</strong> Every successful mission gives your team <strong>+1 point</strong>. Green names = your allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9bd0f779d1f0af586a7f8dfeb4ac7d04.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9bd0f779d1f0af586a7f8dfeb4ac7d04.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9bd0f779d1f0af586a7f8dfeb4ac7d04.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Warning:</strong> If you\u2019re caught while transporting items, that mission round is void and a teammate must restart it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/3bceb8a720e9ea90002aee48eb5d1146.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udccc <strong>Pick a Tool!</strong> Choose 1 gadget each round to help expose spies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/2892a19e69f8fde1f4f2e88a8392ecca.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/2892a19e69f8fde1f4f2e88a8392ecca.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/2892a19e69f8fde1f4f2e88a8392ecca.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0\u00a0<strong>Custom Taser</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/82c41710934db661e007696742cd2546.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/82c41710934db661e007696742cd2546.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/82c41710934db661e007696742cd2546.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Custom Sensor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b26e22c7cbc7efc3dccac77c3ebb6691.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b26e22c7cbc7efc3dccac77c3ebb6691.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b26e22c7cbc7efc3dccac77c3ebb6691.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Disguise Kit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/880639d713cf572987646c25971dae3c.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/880639d713cf572987646c25971dae3c.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/880639d713cf572987646c25971dae3c.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Baton</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Be careful:</strong> Wrong guesses give the Spies extra points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd0e\u00a0<strong>Watch Closely!</strong> Follow NPCs, study behaviors, and look for suspicious moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9da5712ace9482a6e594090adaa32566.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9da5712ace9482a6e594090adaa32566.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9da5712ace9482a6e594090adaa32566.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\ude4b <strong>Vote!</strong> When the round ends, discuss and pick 1 suspect to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b96a1f91febb9566927d0b481c83f427.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b96a1f91febb9566927d0b481c83f427.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b96a1f91febb9566927d0b481c83f427.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Wrong votes</strong> = points for the Spies. If votes tie, the system randomly picks among the tied suspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd0e\u00a0<strong>Report!</strong> Found missing or tampered items? Hit report to start an immediate vote.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/5a6408106d317727d2f52a11418731fd.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/5a6408106d317727d2f52a11418731fd.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/23d5e5729dad387678b1b6fff8d26852.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83e\udd20 8 unique Detective character options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b6cf505045aa99fbe6807b067b552d1b.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b6cf505045aa99fbe6807b067b552d1b.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd7a Fun emotes for both sides, each with unique animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/acc91b7a1050e45bb4587dfd89ea268b.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/acc91b7a1050e45bb4587dfd89ea268b.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/acc91b7a1050e45bb4587dfd89ea268b.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc4d Flexible room settings to fit your party style: choose maps, round times, number of spies, number of missions, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/ab4e549909d1bf6180e517edd2e6b941.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/ab4e549909d1bf6180e517edd2e6b941.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/ab4e549909d1bf6180e517edd2e6b941.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/51d063354a2e2e2f7647b7ec00b59df2.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd2b <strong>Detectives:</strong> Miss your mark? Enter PVP mode. Arm up and eliminate every Spy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/c8faef2884202f1e3e4d57581709619d.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/c8faef2884202f1e3e4d57581709619d.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/c8faef2884202f1e3e4d57581709619d.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd38Miss your shot at exposing all the spies? It\u2019s revenge time! Enter PVP mode, draw your pistol, and gun down the spies to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udd9a <strong>Spies:</strong> Missions complete? Unlock deadly weapons and turn the hunt around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1581d788529269286395e6bc66666906.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1581d788529269286395e6bc66666906.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1581d788529269286395e6bc66666906.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd38Hit the mission score limit and the game flips. Your team unlocks stronger weapons and gets the chance to hunt the Detectives instead. Stay alive, strike back, and turn the tables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Ready to bluff, deceive, and outplay your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Unmask the Spy in AGENT VERSUS.\u00a0( -_\u2022)\u2584\ufe3b\u30c6\u062d\u0643\u0640\u2501\u4e00\ud83d\udca5</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861140?t=1762295066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/56d2dd8ba938c18e634fe45ecb4204c90aec3486/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762295066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/f8ac760b10acf3e4fc96f9674c564538063b3709/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762295066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/f8ac760b10acf3e4fc96f9674c564538063b3709/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762295066","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/4ae977b88a0f3dd069b59a72656c8630.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udce2 Get your party ready for an online Social Deduction game for 2\u20138 players! Step into the role of a Special Agent in a thrilling showdown between two sides:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\udd39 Spies who must blend in with NPCs and complete secret missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\udd39 Detectives who must expose the Spies hiding among the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Sharpen your skills to act natural and outsmart the Detectives or use your eagle eyes to hunt down the Spies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd2b When Spies and Detectives collide, the real game begins in AGENT VERSUS! \ud83c\udfae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1af3c372912e7d180699b781e59dfbef.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/d6c1270c347dbc1fc55d8763a36eb98c.avif?t=1762295066\" width=734 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/aba79cc3d31ce2fe8616cad5f39970eb.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc53 <strong>Disguise!</strong> Blend in as one of 12 NPC characters and copy their behaviors as naturally as possible. Don\u2019t let the Detectives notice anything odd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/abb42c0c6bccc6acef731852342fda1f.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/abb42c0c6bccc6acef731852342fda1f.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/abb42c0c6bccc6acef731852342fda1f.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc53 <strong>Do Missions!</strong> Check the top-right corner for active tasks. Follow the orange highlights on the map to complete objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc65 <strong>Team Up!</strong> Every successful mission gives your team <strong>+1 point</strong>. Green names = your allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9bd0f779d1f0af586a7f8dfeb4ac7d04.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9bd0f779d1f0af586a7f8dfeb4ac7d04.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9bd0f779d1f0af586a7f8dfeb4ac7d04.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Warning:</strong> If you\u2019re caught while transporting items, that mission round is void and a teammate must restart it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/3bceb8a720e9ea90002aee48eb5d1146.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udccc <strong>Pick a Tool!</strong> Choose 1 gadget each round to help expose spies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/2892a19e69f8fde1f4f2e88a8392ecca.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/2892a19e69f8fde1f4f2e88a8392ecca.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/2892a19e69f8fde1f4f2e88a8392ecca.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0\u00a0<strong>Custom Taser</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/82c41710934db661e007696742cd2546.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/82c41710934db661e007696742cd2546.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/82c41710934db661e007696742cd2546.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Custom Sensor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b26e22c7cbc7efc3dccac77c3ebb6691.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b26e22c7cbc7efc3dccac77c3ebb6691.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b26e22c7cbc7efc3dccac77c3ebb6691.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Disguise Kit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/880639d713cf572987646c25971dae3c.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/880639d713cf572987646c25971dae3c.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/880639d713cf572987646c25971dae3c.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Baton</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Be careful:</strong> Wrong guesses give the Spies extra points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd0e\u00a0<strong>Watch Closely!</strong> Follow NPCs, study behaviors, and look for suspicious moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9da5712ace9482a6e594090adaa32566.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9da5712ace9482a6e594090adaa32566.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/9da5712ace9482a6e594090adaa32566.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\ude4b <strong>Vote!</strong> When the round ends, discuss and pick 1 suspect to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b96a1f91febb9566927d0b481c83f427.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b96a1f91febb9566927d0b481c83f427.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b96a1f91febb9566927d0b481c83f427.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Wrong votes</strong> = points for the Spies. If votes tie, the system randomly picks among the tied suspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd0e\u00a0<strong>Report!</strong> Found missing or tampered items? Hit report to start an immediate vote.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/5a6408106d317727d2f52a11418731fd.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/5a6408106d317727d2f52a11418731fd.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/23d5e5729dad387678b1b6fff8d26852.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83e\udd20 8 unique Detective character options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b6cf505045aa99fbe6807b067b552d1b.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/b6cf505045aa99fbe6807b067b552d1b.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd7a Fun emotes for both sides, each with unique animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/acc91b7a1050e45bb4587dfd89ea268b.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/acc91b7a1050e45bb4587dfd89ea268b.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/acc91b7a1050e45bb4587dfd89ea268b.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc4d Flexible room settings to fit your party style: choose maps, round times, number of spies, number of missions, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/ab4e549909d1bf6180e517edd2e6b941.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/ab4e549909d1bf6180e517edd2e6b941.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/ab4e549909d1bf6180e517edd2e6b941.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/51d063354a2e2e2f7647b7ec00b59df2.avif?t=1762295066\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd2b <strong>Detectives:</strong> Miss your mark? Enter PVP mode. Arm up and eliminate every Spy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/c8faef2884202f1e3e4d57581709619d.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/c8faef2884202f1e3e4d57581709619d.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/c8faef2884202f1e3e4d57581709619d.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd38Miss your shot at exposing all the spies? It\u2019s revenge time! Enter PVP mode, draw your pistol, and gun down the spies to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udd9a <strong>Spies:</strong> Missions complete? Unlock deadly weapons and turn the hunt around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1581d788529269286395e6bc66666906.poster.avif?t=1762295066\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1581d788529269286395e6bc66666906.webm?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/extras/1581d788529269286395e6bc66666906.mp4?t=1762295066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd38Hit the mission score limit and the game flips. Your team unlocks stronger weapons and gets the chance to hunt the Detectives instead. Stay alive, strike back, and turn the tables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Ready to bluff, deceive, and outplay your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Unmask the Spy in AGENT VERSUS.\u00a0( -_\u2022)\u2584\ufe3b\u30c6\u062d\u0643\u0640\u2501\u4e00\ud83d\udca5</p>","developers":["Game Inside Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861140/6674785e62953eb94977cdf7d599795f8b9c9c6d/header.jpg?t=1762295066","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861140/1268074806/dd6aa65f66eaa71823ee97b931c7d02862321a65/1760991594/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762021239","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.